cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "EVIDENT: Intrinsically Explainable Anomaly Detection in Dynamic Graphs"
abstract: >-
  EVIDENT is an ante-hoc intrinsically explainable anomaly detector for
  dynamic graphs. Its score is computed exclusively from a sparse, dually
  factorised evidence set selected by the model, so sufficiency is
  guaranteed by construction rather than estimated post hoc.
license: MIT
repository-code: "FILL IN: https://github.com/<user>/EVIDENT"
authors:
