    family-names: "FILL IN"
    affiliation: "LCSI Laboratory, Ecole nationale Superieure d'Informatique (ESI), Algiers, Algeria"
keywords:
  - dynamic graphs
  - anomaly detection
  - explainable AI
  - intrinsic explainability
  - graph neural networks
